<title>POLAND: Rafako approves Elektrim issue.</title>
<headline>Rafako approves Elektrim issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of the Polish industrial boiler maker Rafako SA approved a new issue of 8.07 million shares for the industrial and trading conglomerate Elektrim SA at 11.25 zlotys each, Rafako's deputy head said.</p>
<p>Antoni Szyndzielorz told Reuters the issue, which would give Elektrim a 46 percent stake in Rafako, still required the Securities Commission approval.</p>
<p>After the issue Rafako's capital will be divided into 17.4 million shares. On Monday Rafako shares traded at 14.6 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
